&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sail is Stripe’s user interface platform and design system. We build the design language, components, tools, and front-end foundations that product teams use to create coherent, accessible, responsive, and high-quality experiences. Designers on Sail work closely with engineers and designers across Stripe to turn recurring product needs into durable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer on Sail, you’ll contribute to the visual and interaction foundations of Stripe’s products. With support from experienced designers and engineers, you’ll work on scoped components, patterns, guidance, and tools. This role is a good fit for a designer who cares deeply about visual craft, enjoys thinking in systems, and wants to understand how design decisions become production interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and refine user interface components, patterns, and foundations for use across Stripe products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create polished, coherent interfaces across interaction states, themes, and responsive layouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with front-end engineers to understand constraints and carry designs into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Figma libraries, prototypes, specifications, documentation, and examples&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather input from product teams, share work, and iterate based on feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience designing digital products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating strong visual design craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or contributing to a design system or component library&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with front-end engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working understanding of components, states, and responsive behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence tools in day-to-day design work, with familiarity with large language models, agents, and reusable skills or workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating or maintaining user interface components or shared design libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML and CSS, with experience using artificial intelligence and prototyping tools to build and evaluate interactive interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing native mobile interfaces for iOS or Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technically-minded product designer who is excited to shape how design, code, and AI-powered workflows come together at Figma. In this role, you&#39;ll improve how Figma understands production code and design systems, design workflows that move from design to code and back again, and extend Figma&#39;s agentic capabilities into developer tools and the places teams already work. You&#39;ll turn ambiguity into clarity alongside engineers, PMs, and researchers, bringing simplicity and craft to complex technical problems as we help define the future of how software is made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role that can be held from our London hub or remotely within the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and prototype new workflows that bring design and production code closer together, including AI-powered experiences that connect Figma with the tools teams already use to build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall strategy and decision-making about product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver and refine clear storytelling around product needs and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product management, engineering, UX writing, data science, and research peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and iterate on flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals, as well as provide thoughtful feedback for others doing the same so you can all do your best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship high-quality features and product improvements in Figma&#39;s core product surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our design org&#39;s culture by participating in design critiques, mentoring peers, and sharing best practices across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience designing UX and UI for software products of similar scale and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual craft and attention to detail across composition, typography, layout, interaction design, and prototyping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently drive end-to-end design processes from discovery through launch, balancing user needs, technical constraints, and business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to guide decision-making through structured thinking, clear design rationale, and user-centered research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing technically complex products, ideally developer tools or extensible platforms, with an understanding of software development workflows, APIs, and systems; experience prototyping and evaluating AI-powered or nondeterministic interactions is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web technologies like HTML/CSS, AI coding tools such as Codex, Cursor, or Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of advanced Figma features like Auto Layout, Variables, and Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with web technologies, APIs, CLIs, MCP, model evals, or other tools used to create developer and AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of working on canvas-based interfaces or tools that support creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work involving design systems, like creating, maintaining, or contributing to a design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations-ext@figma.com&quot;&gt;accommodations-ext@figma.com&lt;/a&gt;. These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Product Design to lead a team of product designers working across some of Contentful’s most foundational product areas: content performance optimization, application platform capabilities, business foundations, and design systems. Contentful is the composable content platform powering how the world&#39;s leading brands create, manage, and deliver digital experiences. These teams enable our platform&#39;s evolution as we build AI native features — turning ambitious product strategy into intuitive, well-crafted experiences for the customers and partners who build on Contentful every day. You&#39;ll balance strategic design leadership with people management: coaching designers, raising the bar on craft, and ensuring design has a strong voice in how these foundational parts of the platform take shape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;What To Expect?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll manage designers across three product areas: content performance optimization, application platform capabilities, business infrastructure, and design systems. Optimization, Application Foundations and Business Foundations. While all teams strive to deliver solutions for a holistic, unified platform, each has a distinct focus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Optimization group focuses on advancing personalization and analytics capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Application Foundations group includes design systems &amp;amp; information architecture, as well as workflows &amp;amp; automation tooling, and search &amp;amp; discoverability. Notably, the Contentful platform is built on our open source design system, Forma 36.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Business Foundations group focuses on identity &amp;amp; access, monetization, and platform insights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll manage a team of designers you can genuinely invest in — coaching career growth, shaping how they work, and giving them real ownership over their piece of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll partner directly with product and engineering leadership on strategy, not just execution to shape how Optimization, Application Foundations, and Business Foundations evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll help define what AI-native design leadership looks like at Contentful, at a moment when the company is actively maturing that muscle. The Contentful platform includes AI powered customer facing features, and accordingly, we progressively evolve our design tooling and ways of working to take advantage of emerging technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can be located in or near our London hub. The product designers you manage will be located in EMEA as well, distributed across London, Dublin and our Berlin headquarters. Your manager will be US based and you will collaborate with colleagues globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some travel is expected. The organization typically has training and/or workshops located in our Berlin headquarters, approximately quarterly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be joining at a pivotal moment: Contentful&#39;s recent acquisition by Salesforce puts this team&#39;s work in front of a massive new customer base, giving you a rare chance to help shape design at a large scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need To Be Successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product design experience, including 3+ years directly managing and developing product designers, ideally at a B2B SaaS or platform company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of partnering with product and engineering leadership at the strategy level, not just translating requirements. You will influence roadmap decisions, represent design&#39;s perspective in cross-functional planning, and drive visioning initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong customer-centric orientation. You ground design and product decisions in real customer insights and instill that same instinct across your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of design leadership that extends beyond your own team. Experience shaping and evolving the product design function’s practices within an organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high bar for design craft, with a portfolio reflecting strong interaction and visual design fundamentals. You set and uphold that same bar across your team by giving specific, actionable feedback that sharpens execution, not just strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading design for complex, multi-team product areas. You should influence a coherent vision that translates across teams supporting a unified platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or contributing to a design system at scale; familiarity with design systems like Forma 36.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing distributed, global teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in AI-native product design, including shipping AI-powered customer-facing features, as well as evolving design tooling and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio evidence of coaching designers&#39; career growth. Experience facilitating promotions, skill development, and performance management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a technically complex, enterprise/platform context. The interfaces and user flows we design operate within a headless, API first context and a mindset of ‘systems thinking’ is paramount.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More details about our company benefits can be found at the following link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link__new-tab&quot; href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contentful is now officially part of Salesforce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need reasonable accommodations at any point during the application or interview process, please let your Recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers who may fraudulently claim to be from Contentful. These types of fraud can occur through copycat websites, fake email addresses claiming to be from our company, or social media. We do not ask for your personal information, such as bank account numbers, identification numbers, etc., through social media or chat-based apps, nor do we request or send money to purchase business equipment. If you suspect fraud, please report it to your local authorities and contact us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:security@contentful.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;security@contentful.com&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;with any information you may have.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By clicking “Apply for this job,” I acknowledge that I have read the “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/legal/us/privacy-notice-to-candidates/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contentful’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;” and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

THE WORLD’S MOST ADVANCED VPN, AND A WHOLE LOT MORE.

If you’re a curious problem-solver who carves their own path, join the team behind Threat Protection Pro, the NordLynx protocol, and the fastest VPN on the planet—tools that put privacy, security, and control back in people’s hands.

Your impact? Helping millions take back control of their online security, privacy, and data.




MAIN RESPONSIBILITIES

 - Full ownership of feedback sources for product quality issues; 

 - Roadmap for detection and prevention improvements;

 - Prioritization of issues for resolution;

 - Collaboration with product owners, engineers, and other stakeholders, identification of blockers, management of dependencies and resources;

 - Monitoring and continuous iteration on detection performance;

 - Reporting results and status to upper management and other stakeholders;

 - Align objectives, expectations, and timeframes among developers, designers, product, and business stakeholders;

 - Embrace transparency and communication.

 


CORE REQUIREMENTS

 - Proven experience working as a product owner, IT project manager, or Product manager;

 - Proven experience in working with development teams;

 - Proven experience in identifying deliverable dependencies, roadblocks, or challenges;

 - Strong technical understanding of how software is built, deployed, and maintained;

 - Excellent interpersonal and communication skills;

 - Solid organizational skills, including attention to detail and multitasking skills;

 - Leadership, Risk Management, Critical Thinking, Analytical Skills.



 


WHAT WE OFFER

 - Sharpen your edge: training, mentorship, and room to grow — always.



 - Take the time you need: extra vacation days, sick days, and time off when life calls.



 - Get premium healthcare: private health insurance in Lithuania and Poland — fully covered.



 - Protect your peace: enjoy free subscriptions to Calm, Headspace, and Mindletic, and our own resilience and mindfulness trainings.



 - Own your fitness: in-house gyms, sport cards, online workouts, and personal guidance — on us.



 - Pack your bags for workation: experience our company-wide trip abroad to the fullest.



 - Work from anywhere: work from wherever keeps you in the zone.



 - Celebrate your milestones: birthdays, weddings, and new family members — all deserve a gift.



 - Parent with ease: children’s summer camps and flexibility around the schedule — because parenting never pauses.



 - Join the party: team building and company events people talk about for months.



 - Unlock Cyber City: coffee bar, open gyms, kids’ room, music room, massage chairs — our Vilnius HQ is yours to enjoy.





Kindly refer to our Privacy Notice for Recruitment Candidates https://drive.google.com/file/d/1b2tV684_SYV1jQ4kuf91cnzrRBk3ef-5/view for comprehensive information regarding our data handling procedures throughout recruitment processes.

We expect all candidates to provide accurate and complete information during the recruitment process. While limited use of AI tools to refine application materials is acceptable, candidates remain fully responsible for ensuring that their submissions reflect their own qualifications, skills, and experience. Any failure to do so may negatively affect participation in the recruitment process. If broader AI assistance is allowed for a particular role or stage, we’ll let you know in advance.

By submitting your application, you acknowledge that it may be processed using automated tools for evaluation purposes. As part of our recruitment process, we may use an AI-based application review tool to help assess applications based on skills and experience relevant to the role. This technology is used to support - not replace - human decision-making, and every application is ultimately reviewed by a recruiter.

If you would like more information about how AI is used in this process or wish to exercise your rights under applicable data privacy laws, please contact us at privacy@nordaccount.com. Should you prefer to opt out of the automated evaluation, please submit your application directly to career@nordsec.com.

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Scale is hiring a Staff/Senior Product Designer to lead product design for Scale’s&amp;nbsp; rapidly growing ‘AI for Enterprise Data’ business unit. The mission of AI for Enterprise Data is to accelerate the deployment of AI by helping large enterprises solve their most ambitious challenges.&amp;nbsp; This role will take on multiple products ranging from 0-1 initiatives to improving established products. This includes a suite of powerful AI tools for insurance AI, document processing, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Design end to end user flows, wireframes, high-fidelity mockups, and interactive prototypes for desktop web applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientists, and Operations team members to solve product and business challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Advocate for the voice of the user as the founding designer of the business unit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prioritize and execute work in a fast paced environment with rapid timelines and high amounts of scope and ambiguity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the evolution of our company-wide design system and interaction patterns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take ownership to identify product gaps and rally support for proposed solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience leading end-to-end B2B and enterprise web applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extremely high proficiency in Figma, fast execution speed is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience designing&amp;nbsp; dashboards, data visualization, domain-specific editors, and forms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Understanding of front-end development processes for web interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, including customer-facing meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Portfolio of product design projects that highlight your diversity of skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exposure to artificial intelligence, machine learning, and other technical concepts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at accommodations@scale.com. Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 이커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 이커머스 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는 여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;팀 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;와우멤버십 UX 팀은 멤버십 서비스를 통해 고객들에게 더 나은 경험을 선사하는데 집중하고 있습니다. 와우 회원은 충성도가 높은 단골 고객으로 매일 쿠팡을 필요로 하고 있으며, 와우멤버십 UX 팀은 고객들의 경험을 더욱 편리하고 신뢰할 수 있도록 만들기 위해 노력하고 있습니다. 이를 위해서 다양한 디자인 업무 및 실험들을 진행하고 있으며, 조직 내에서도 자유롭게 피드백을 주고 받으며 고객들을 위한 훌륭한 경험을 만드는 것에 모든 역량을 집중합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Staff Product Designer는 빠르게 변화하는 비즈니스 환경에서 고객의 문제를 해결하기 위해 다른 디자이너 분들을 이끌며 Design Thinking을 바탕으로 Ideation부터 최종 개발 단계까지, 프로덕트 제작의 전과정을 책임집니다. 사용자 시나리오, 사용자 여정, 와이어 프레임, UI 디 자인과 프로토타입을 능숙하게 제작할 수 있으며, 비즈니스 요구 사항을 이해하고, 정성적, 정량 적 데이터를 근거로 활용하여 디자인의 방향성을 제시할 수 있습니다. 이를 이루어 내기 위해 개 발 조직, PM(Product Manager), 마케팅, 법무, 인사 등 다양한 팀과의 업무를 조율하게 됩니다. 나아가 비즈니스가 성장하는데 있어 필요한 크고 작은 프로젝트와 전략에 기여하며, 팀 문화 형성과 프로세스 수립을 주도합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비지니스, 엔지니어, 프로덕트팀과 커뮤니케이션하며 전반적인 디자인 프로젝트를 리드&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;제품 비전과 로드맵 수립에 적극 참여하고 전략적 의사결정에 기여&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product UX 안에서 다른 디자인 리드들과 업무 협의를 통한 효율적 프로세스 강화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As-is 프로덕트, 서비스의 문제점을 발굴하고 분석하여 개선 방향을 우선 순위로 제시&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;효율적인 디자인팀 리소스 운영과 디자인팀 채용에도 기여&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;디자인 퀄리티 책임과 개선 방향성 제시&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;주니어, 시니어 디자이너 커리어 코칭과 멘토링&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격 요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;그래픽 디자인, 인터랙션 디자인, 산업 디자인, HCI, 컴퓨터 공학, 심리학 학사 학위 또는 이에 준하는 경력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;타이포그라피, 인터랙션 디자인, 시각 디자인 및 사용자 연구를 잘 보여주는 우수한 포트폴리오&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;피그마, 스케치, 제플린, 어도비 등 디자인툴을 능숙하게 사용하는 능력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8년 이상의 프로덕트 디자인 경력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;팀 단위의 프로젝트를 통해 다른 디자이너들을 이끄신 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로젝트의 전체적인 전략을 세우고 결과물의 근거를 만든 경험을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;커뮤니케이션과 스토리텔링 능력이 우수하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대 사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;빠르게 성장하는 환경에서 다양한 팀과 협업한 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX 리서치에서 도출한 인사이트를 활용하여 프로젝트를 시작부터 끝까지 제작한 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터를 분석하여 디자인에 반영하는 능력이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;다양한 업무관계자를 이끌며, 복잡한 프로젝트를 운영하고 관리한 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고객, 셀러 그리고 비즈니스에 대해 다각도로 파악할 수 있는 이커머스 업계에 대한 지식을 가지신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;업무에 임하는 진지한 자세와 리더십이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;주니어 디자이너와 시니어 디자이너에 대한 멘토링 능력이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;한국어 및 영어 의사소통이 능통하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 1차면접 - 2차면접 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupang.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;회사 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡의 핀테크 사업은 소비자와 판매자 모두가 확장된 금융 서비스 솔루션을 누릴 수 있도록 새로운 방식을 선보이고 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쿠팡페이는 Coupang.com 및 쿠팡이츠에서 상품을 구매하는 고객부터 쿠팡의 오픈마켓을 이용하는 판매자 그리고 쿠팡이츠 가맹점까지 쿠팡을 이용하는 모든 이들에게 혁신적인 결제 및 금융 서비스 솔루션을 제공하는 데 중점을 두고 있습니다. 쿠팡페이는 최신 기술을 통해 한국과 대만의 쿠팡 고객의 니즈에 부응하기 위해 원터치 결제 서비스와 같은 금융 솔루션을 개발합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;대출 분야에서는 업계 최고 수준의 리워드를 제공하는 와우 신용 카드 (제휴)를 빠르게 확장시키고 있습니다. 쿠팡 입점 사업자(셀러)의 사업 성장을 위해 쿠팡페이는 한국 최초의 BaaS (Banking as a Service) 기능을 사용하여 다양한 유동성 옵션을 구축하고 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;금융과 기술을 결합한 핀테크 분야 내에서 광범위한 경험을 쌓으며 업무하시길 원한다면, 쿠팡 페이와 함께 하세요. 우리는 고객이 계산하는 시간을 줄여서 고객이 좋아하는 것을 쇼핑하는 데 더 많은 시간을 보낼 수 있도록 돕습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;직무 소개&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Staff Product Designer는 전략 수립부터 실행까지 주요 제품 경험 전반을 주도하는 핵심 리더입니다.&lt;br&gt;숙련된 경험을 바탕으로 다양한 이해관계자와 긴밀히 협업하며, 본인의 디자인 비전과 아이디어를 구체화하고 최고 수준의 프로덕트를 설계할 수 있는 역량을 요구합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;실무형 디자인 리더 (Hands-on Design Leader): 쿠팡 제품 디자인팀은 실무형(Hands-on) 디자인 문화를 지향합니다. 우리는 리더가 디자인 문제를 해결할 때 사려 깊은 프로세스, 세련된 디자인, 고객 중심 관점을 보여주는 숙련된 디자이너가 되기를 기대합니다. 또한 팀 결과의 속도와 품질에 대한 책임을 지게 되므로, 팀을 이끌고 모든 세부 사항에서 우수성을 요구하는 데 자신감을 가져야 합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;전체적인 문제 해결사 (Holistic Problem Solver): 리더는 체계적으로 사고하고 직관과 근거(데이터, 모범 사례 벤치마크, 테스트 및 분석 등)를 활용하여 복잡한 고객 문제에 대한 혁신적인 해결책을 찾아야 합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;업무 내용&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;고객 경험을 위한 프로덕트 목표 달성 및 디자인 방향성 주도&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;비즈니스 리더, 프로덕트 매니저, 개발, 운영 및 마케팅 등 다양한 이해관계자와의 긴밀한 협업을 통한 전략적 방향성 설정&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;제품 로드맵 및 우선순위 논의에 참여하고 디자인 관점을 반영&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;플랫폼 전반의 디자인 시스템 개선 및 표준 정립 주도&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로덕트 오너십을 가지고 협업 및 우선순위 관리를 통한 최종 품질 확보&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터에 기반한 문제 정의 및 UX 전략 수립&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지표 기반 반복 개선 및 A/B 테스트 수행을 통한 제품 최적화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;신규 디바이스 및 미래 사용 환경에 대한 탐색 및 선행 디자인&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;자격&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;요건&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;적극적인 실행력과 높은 책임감으로 필요한 업무를 완벽하게 마무리하는 능력 있으신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8년 이상의 프로덕트 디자인 관련 경력 있으신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;학사 학위 보유자 (그래픽 디자인, 인터랙션 디자인, 산업 디자인, HCI, 컴퓨터 과학, 심리학 등 관련 분야)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;시장에 성공적으로 출시된 제품/디자인 작업을 포함하는 포트폴리오 제출 가능하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figma, Adobe Creative Suite 등의 디자인 도구를 숙련되게 활용하는 능력 갖추신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;인사이트 추출, 사용자 여정 생성, 와이어프레임부터 UI 디자인까지 디자인 프로세스를 엔드 투 엔드로 주도하는 능력 있으신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;엔지니어와 직접 협력하여 설계가 제대로 구현되었는지 확인하고 품질을 관리할 수 있는 능력 있으신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;프로덕트 오너와 협력하여 제품 전략 수립 및 로드맵 우선순위 설정 경험 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우대&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;빠르게 성장하는 조직에서 대규모 서비스 디자인 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX 리서치 기획 및 사용자 인터뷰/테스트 기반의 의사결정 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터 기반 반복 개선 및 성과 측정 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;이커머스 또는 영상 스트리밍 산업에 대한 깊은 이해&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;협업 과정에서 강력한 영향력을 발휘하여 디자인 목표를 관철한 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;근무지&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서울 광진로 아차산로 412 (이스트폴 타워 구의)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;재택근무 가능&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형 절차 및&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;안내&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;전형&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;절차&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;서류전형 - 직무 적합성 인터뷰 - 핵심 역량 인터뷰 – 최종 합격&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형절차는 직무별로 다르게 운영될 수 있으며, 일정 및 상황에 따라 변동될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전형 일정 및 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;참고&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사항&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 공고는 모집 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;취업 보호 대상자(보훈대상자, 장애인 등)는 관련 법률에 따라 채용우대를 받을 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;직급과 담당 업무 범위는 후보자의 전반적인 경력과 경험 등 제반사정을 고려하여 변경될 수 있습니다. 이러한 변경이 필요할 경우, 최종 합격 통지 전 적절한 시기에 후보자와 커뮤니케이션 될 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;채용 및 업무 수행과 관련하여 요구되는 법령상 자격이 갖추어지지 않은 경우 채용이 제한될 수 있습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;고용형태는&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;정규직으로&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;수습기간&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt; 12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;주를&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;포함&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;합니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;. 단, 업무상 필요한 경우에는 상기 수습기간을 적용하지 않거나 단축 또는 연장할 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;KO-KR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW154164593 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;개인정보 처리방침&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;쿠팡 그룹은 입사지원자 개인정보 처리방침(아래 링크)에 따라 귀하의 개인정보를 수집하여 처리합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/kr/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;서류&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;반환 정책&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;본 고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률』 제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupangpay.com&lt;/a&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;우리는 게이머의 로망을 실현하기 위해, 누구도 가지 않는 길을 갑니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;예상을 뛰어넘는 과감한 상상력과 기술로, 전 세계 팬들이 잊지 못할 세상을 만들기 위해 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;담대하게 도전하고 개척합니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We pioneer the path to players&#39; dreams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;With bold imagination and breakthrough technology, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;we create unforgettable worlds for fans across the globe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우리 팀(프로젝트)을 소개합니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;Publishing Platform 본부 UI&amp;amp;UX 디자이너는 KRAFTON 퍼블리싱 플랫폼의 일관된 사용자 경험과 브랜드 정체성을 설계하고 확장하는 역할을 수행합니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;플랫폼 서비스 전반의 사용자 흐름을 설계하고, 다양한 채널, 서비스, 시장을 고려하여 브랜드 일관성과 사용자 경험을 아우르는 디자인 전략을 수립하며, 브랜드 가이드와 마케팅 디자인으로 브랜드 인지도를 높입니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;우리는 사용자에게 브랜드의 가치를 전달하고 최적의 경험을 제공합니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;우리 팀과 함께할 미션을 소개합니다.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;UI/UX 설계 및 전략 수립 : 플랫폼 전반의 사용자 경험을 위한 UI/UX 기획과 흐름, 인터랙션 설계&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;디자인 시스템 운영 : 일관된 브랜드 경험을 위한 디자인 시스템과 컴포넌트 구축/관리&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;데이터 기반 문제 해결 : 사용자 행동 데이터, 리서치 결과를 바탕으로 디자인 방향성 수립 및 사용자 경험 최적화&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;글로벌 협업 : 국내외 유관 부서(기획, 개발, 마케팅 등)와 긴밀하게 소통하며, 다양한 문화권의 사용자 환경을 고려한 UX/UI 설계 및 프로젝트 협업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;이런 경험을 가진 분과 함께 성장하고 싶습니다! (필수요건)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;3년 이상의 UI/UX 디자인 경력과 디자인 시스템을 직접 구축하고 운영한 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;Figma를 중심으로, 필요에 따라 Adobe CC 등의 툴을 활용해 서비스 목적에 맞는 화면과 사용자 흐름을 효과적으로 설계할 수 있는 역량&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;웹/모바일 환경에 대한 깊은 이해를 바탕으로 반응형 플랫폼에 적합한 사용자 중심 설계 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;기획, 개발, 마케팅 등 다양한 유관 부서와의 협업 경험과 논리적이고 유연한 커뮤니케이션 역량&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;명확한 책임감과 오너십을 바탕으로 복잡한 UX 과제를 주도적으로 이끌거나 완수한 경험&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;해외 출장에 결격 사유가 없는 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;이런 경험들이 있다면 저희가 찾는 그 분입니다! (우대요건)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;사용자를 대상으로 한 서비스 또는 플랫폼의 디자인 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;브랜드 경험을 기획하고 디자인한 경험이 있으신 분&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;크래프톤의 도전에 함께 하기 위해 아래의 전형 과정이 필요합니다.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;서류 전형 &amp;gt; 사전 인터뷰 (Phone Interview) &amp;gt; *과제 전형 &amp;gt; 인성검사 (Personality Assessment) &amp;gt; 직무면접 (Technical Fit Interview) &amp;gt; 종합면접 (2-3회) (Culture Fit Interview) &amp;gt; 합격 및 입사&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;*해당 절차는 각 포지션 및 후보자에 따라 변동이 있을 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;상시 채용으로 채용 완료 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;필요 시, 인터뷰 및 직무 테스트가 추가될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;전형 일정 및 합격 또는 불합격 결과는 지원서에 등록하신 이메일 또는 유선으로 개별 안내 드립니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;JobPostSetting-필요서류를확인해주세요!-제출서류/포트폴리오(필수및선택서류꼭확인!)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;필요 서류를 확인해주세요!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;입사지원서 (자유 양식), 자기소개서, 경력기술서, 포트폴리오(필수)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;신입일 경우 자기소개서를, 경력일 경우 경력기술서를 중심으로 기술해 주시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;포트폴리오 첨부 시, 하단 안내 사항을 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;JobPostSetting-근무지-부서에따라확인하여넣을것&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;근무지&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;역삼 센터필드&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;JobPostSetting-고용형태-채용구분&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;고용형태&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;계약직(1년 3개월,&amp;nbsp;육아휴직 대체, 정규직 전환 비대상)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;아래 안내 사항을 확인해주세요!&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;장애인 및 국가 유공자 등 취업 보호 대상자는 관계 법령에 따라 우대합니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;지원서 내용 중 허위사실이 있는 경우에는 합격이 취소될 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;5개월의 수습기간을 적용합니다. 회사는 수습기간에 대한 평가 결과에 따라 본채용을 거부할 수 있으며, 수습기간 중이라도 중간평가 결과에 따라 수습기간을 조기 종료하고 본채용을 거부할 수 있습니다. 수습기간 내 고용형태 및 급여 조정은 없습니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;채용 전형 중 궁금하신 사항은 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.krafton.com/careers/faq/&quot;&gt;크래프톤 채용 FAQ&lt;/a&gt; 내에서 확인하실 수 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
